{"title":"Christmas Accessories","description":"\u003ch3 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eComplete Your Holiday Décor with Christmas Accessories from King of Christmas\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe finishing touches are what transform a beautifully decorated tree into a complete holiday display. At King of Christmas, our Christmas accessories collection is designed to help you layer texture, color, and detail throughout your space, from the tree itself to any corner of your home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhether you are creating a coordinated theme from scratch or adding the final pieces to an existing display, our Christmas accessories are crafted to complement our full range of \u003ca title=\"Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003eartificial Christmas trees\u003c\/a\u003e, wreaths, garlands, and \u003ca title=\"Accent Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/accent-artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003eaccent trees\u003c\/a\u003e seamlessly. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat Christmas accessories does King of Christmas offer?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eOur Christmas accessories collection includes everything you need to complete your holiday decor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003ca title=\"Christmas Ornaments\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\"\u003eOrnaments\u003c\/a\u003e - Choose from our exclusive hand-blown glass ornament sets and shatterproof ornament sets in a wide range of finishes, colors, and pack sizes to suit any tree size and decorating style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003ca title=\"Christmas Ribbon\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/ribbons\"\u003eRibbon\u003c\/a\u003e - Add elegant bows, and layered loops throughout your tree and home decor with our curated premium ribbon collection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003ca title=\"Decorative Picks\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/picks\"\u003eTree Picks\u003c\/a\u003e - Tuck picks throughout your tree branches to add fullness, texture, and dimension. Picks are especially loved on open-branch trees like the \u003ca title=\"King Noble Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/king-noble-fir-trees\"\u003eKing Noble\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca title=\"Rushmore Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/rushmore-trees\"\u003eRushmore Fir\u003c\/a\u003e, where they help fill the silhouette naturally without overpowering the tree's architectural character.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003ca title=\"King Snow Faux Fur Tree Skirt\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/products\/60-inch-king-snow-faux-fur-tree-skirt?_pos=2\u0026amp;_psq=tree+skirt\u0026amp;_ss=e\u0026amp;_v=1.0\"\u003eTree Skirts\u003c\/a\u003e- Anchor your entire holiday display with a beautifully styled tree skirt that completes the look from the ground up.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003ca title=\"Wooden Decorative Garland\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/products\/wooden-garland?variant=42345861218504\"\u003eWooden Bead Garland\u003c\/a\u003e - Our wooden bead garland adds a warm, natural, and organic touch to your holiday decor. Perfect for draping around your tree, or mantle display, this on-trend accessory pairs beautifully with rustic, neutral, or nature-inspired holiday themes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eHow do I create a cohesive holiday decorating theme?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStart with your tree as the foundation and build outward. Choose a color palette or theme such as classic red and gold, cool winter whites and silvers, warm neutrals, or bold jewel tones. You can then carry that theme through your ornament selection, ribbon and picks. Layering different textures and sizes creates depth and visual interest, while a coordinated tree skirt and garland anchor the overall display.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur Christmas accessories are designed with this layered approach in mind, making it easy to mix and match pieces across categories while keeping your overall look polished and intentional.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eWhat accessories work best for different Christmas tree styles?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe right accessories depend on the character of your tree, and your desired look. For full, dense trees like the \u003ca title=\"Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/royal-fir-trees\"\u003eRoyal Fir\u003c\/a\u003e or \u003ca title=\"Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/yorkshire-fir-trees\"\u003eYorkshire Fir\u003c\/a\u003e, layered ribbon, and a mix of ornament sizes work beautifully to fill the silhouette and create a timeless traditional display.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor open, airy trees like the King Noble or Rushmore Fir, tree picks and carefully placed ornaments are especially effective. The open branch structure lets every accessory breathe and be seen, creating a curated, intentional look.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor flocked trees like the \u003ca title=\"Queen Flock Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/queen-flock-trees\"\u003eQueen Flock\u003c\/a\u003e, or \u003ca title=\"Prince Flock Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/prince-flock-trees\"\u003ePrince Flock\u003c\/a\u003e, cool-toned accessories in silver, white and soft gold complement the snow-dusted branches beautifully, while warm wooden bead garland adds a cozy, organic contrast.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eDo King of Christmas accessories work with any tree?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes. Our Christmas accessories are designed to complement our full range of artificial Christmas trees, from \u003ca title=\"Premium Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/premium-trees\"\u003epremium realistic collections\u003c\/a\u003e, to classic PVC styles. They also pair beautifully with our artificial wreaths and accent trees, making it easy to carry a consistent look throughout your entire home this holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore the Christmas accessories collection and find the pieces that bring your holiday vision to life. \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"glass-sweet-ornament-set-pink","title":"Sweet 30-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Pink - Purple) Limited Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eSugar spice and everything nice with this candy-coated 30-piece hand blown ornament set. Make your tree a sweet delight with our candy-coated inspired arrangement. With an assortment of different shapes, sizes, colors, and textures, this exclusive KOC Collection set will surely give your tree a desired modern look. This sweet themed glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":30092517802048,"sku":"R0T7R3","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/keriannbritt--styled-for-the-season--2025-12-01-08-08-12--instagram.jpg?v=1765556819"},{"product_id":"glass-snowflake-ornament-set","title":"Snowflake 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Blue) Limited Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eEnhance your winter wonderland at home this holiday season, when you adorn your tree with our swanky snowflake inspired 15-piece hand blown ornament set. Designed with class and sophistication, in beautiful hues of blue. This delicate ornament set will surely make your holiday dreams come true. This snowflake themed glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":30092517900352,"sku":"KCX8H9Y","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SnowflakeOrnamentSet.png?v=1771875630"},{"product_id":"4-pack-snowflake-glass-ornament","title":"Snowflake Glass Ornament (4 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eGive your home a winter wonderland ambiance using our mouth-blown, Snowflake ornament. Hand-painted in a matte silver base, lightly accented with platinum glitter, this dainty glass piece will beautifully complement our snowflake ornament set or make for a great holiday gift for family and friends.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":31757328253005,"sku":"snowflake-4-pack","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SnowflakeGlass.png?v=1771875694"},{"product_id":"24-pack-white-essential-glass-ornament","title":"White Essential Glass Ornaments (24 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThere’s just something about an all-white ornament theme that permeates an elegant holiday atmosphere. Give your centerpiece the royal treatment this season, when you adorn it with our 24-piece Essential White hand blown ornament set. Designed with the perfect combination of matte and metallic pieces, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319135408328,"sku":"OR24-WHTE","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/24PackWhiteEssential.jpg?v=1714663469"},{"product_id":"15-pack-blue-gray-glass-ornament","title":"Winter Wonderland 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Blue and Gray)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday tradition, you can’t go wrong with the classic and timeless blue and gray color theme. Bring your tree to life this season, when you adorn it with our 15-piece Winter Wonderland hand blown ornament set. Designed with elegant hues of blue and gray, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319135506632,"sku":"OR15-WW","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/WinterWonderland-BlueandGray15Pack.jpg?v=1722014545"},{"product_id":"4-pack-rustic-stripe","title":"Rustic Stripe Glass Ornament (4 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThere are ornaments. Then there are works of art. Add a dose of unique rustic highlights to your holiday oasis this season, when you adorn your centerpiece with our 4-piece Rustic Striped hand blown ornament set. With an exclusive design that is unlike anything else, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319136620744,"sku":"OR4-RUSTRIPE","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/4PackRusticStripe.jpg?v=1714663386"},{"product_id":"4-pack-rustic-green","title":"Rustic Green Glass Ornament (4 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eAdd some rustic charm to your holiday oasis this season, when you adorn your centerpiece with our 4-piece Rustic Green hand blown ornament set. With an exclusive design that is unlike anything else, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319136882888,"sku":"OR4-RUSGR","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/4PackRusticGreen.jpg?v=1714663358"},{"product_id":"12-pack-reindeer","title":"Rustic Reindeer Ornaments (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eGive Santa’s reindeer the attention they deserve, by highlighting your tree with our 12-piece Rustic Reindeer Ornament Set. With a unique design and quality craftsmanship, these traditional pieces will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. Carefully packaged in a velvet lined box, these must-have ornaments are safe for storage season after season and ready to become a part of your family tradition for years to come!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319137079496,"sku":"OR4-RUSREIN","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/12PackReindeer.jpg?v=1718159290"},{"product_id":"4-pack-diamond","title":"White Diamond Ornament (4 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWe see you. You have an eye for style and creation. When you want to take your centerpiece to the next level, look no further than our 4-piece White Diamond hand blown ornament set. With an exclusive design that is unlike anything else, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. These unique pieces feature a white base highlighted by diamond shaped silver accents. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319137243336,"sku":"OR4-WHTDI","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/4PackDiamondwhite.jpg?v=1714663317"},{"product_id":"4-pack-pine-cone","title":"Pine Cone Ornaments (4 Pack) | King of Christmas","description":"\u003cp\u003eTried and true. No holiday setting is complete without the classic pinecone. Instantly enhance your holiday oasis this season, when you adorn your tree with our 4-piece Pine Ornament Set. Designed with genuine precision, this traditional ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. Carefully packaged in a velvet lined box, these must-have ornaments are safe for storage season after season and ready to become a part of your family tradition for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319137308872,"sku":"OR4-PINE","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/4PackPineCone.jpg?v=1718159282"},{"product_id":"sugar-berry-picks","title":"Sugar Berry Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eAdding a splash of color to your holiday oasis is easy with a set of our faux Sugar Berry Picks. Studded with\n\u003cbr\u003ered berries and featuring slight variations from branch to branch, these picks are the perfect accent for your\n\u003cbr\u003emantel, tabletop display, or anywhere else you need a touch of genuine seasonal ambiance. 12 picks are\n\u003cbr\u003eincluded for endless possibilities!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42332383117512,"sku":"PK12-SUGB","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/RedWhiteBerryTree-2.jpg?v=1722012823"},{"product_id":"netted-ribbon","title":"Netted Stretch Ribbon (10 yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eYour must-have décor is here. Whether you’re putting the finishing touches on your centerpiece, wrapping your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreaths, accessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick splash of Holiday elegance to that space that needs just a bit more, a little ribbon can go a long way. Our sparkling Netted Ribbon offers that final touch that will instantly complement any color theme in style. 10 yards in length, the decorating possibilities are truly endless. Upgrade your décor arsenal today with a roll of versatile Netted Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42345660481736,"sku":"RB-NETTED","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/NettedStretchRibbon_10yards.jpg?v=1714674628"},{"product_id":"wooden-garland","title":"Wooden Decorative Garland (3 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe accessory you didn’t know you needed. Hand-strung by skilled artisans, our Wooden Garland demands\n\u003cbr\u003eattention and offers an elegant upgrade to any space in need of some extra holiday magic. With 3 Wooden\n\u003cbr\u003eGarlands in each pack, the decorating possibilities are truly endless. Metal hooks on each end ensure easy setup no matter where you choose to place them. Give your holiday oasis an extra dose of refined style this season, with a pack of Wooden Garlands.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42345861218504,"sku":"GAR-WOODEN","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/WoodGarlandFlatLay.jpg?v=1718159364"},{"product_id":"15-pack-white-silver-glass-ornament","title":"Winter Frost 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set (White-Silver)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the\n\u003cbr\u003eornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the\n\u003cbr\u003emost memorable moments of the season. That means\n\u003cbr\u003eyou can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each\n\u003cbr\u003eLimited Edition Winter Frost Glass Ornament Set is\n\u003cbr\u003ecarefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your\n\u003cbr\u003eChristmas tree and the memories that surround it.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith 15 distinctly designed pieces offering a unique\n\u003cbr\u003efrosty elegance of silver, gray and white; this refined set\n\u003cbr\u003egives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that\n\u003cbr\u003edemands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036302024,"sku":"MLK6K5N","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P10203892.png?v=1714674799"},{"product_id":"48-pack-white-shatterproof","title":"White Shatterproof Ornaments (48 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you have kids, cats, or simply want that extra peace of mind when hanging or storing your ornament collection, you can’t go wrong with the unmatched durability of a beautiful shatterproof set. Each White Shatterproof Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 48 shatterproof pieces offering a beautiful wintery blend of gloss and matte whites; this gorgeous set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that not only demands attention but also withstands any attacks from your furry friends!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036400328,"sku":"QEB2T3M","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/WhiteShatterproofornaments.png?v=1785526273"},{"product_id":"48-pack-red-green-shatterproof","title":"Red and Green Shatterproof Ornaments (48 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you have kids, cats, or simply want that extra peace of mind when hanging or storing your ornament collection, you can’t go wrong with the unmatched durability of a beautiful shatterproof set. Each Red and Green Shatterproof Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 48 shatterproof pieces offering a classic blend of gloss and matte reds \u0026amp; greens, this colorful set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that not only demands attention but also withstands any attacks from your furry friends or little ones!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036498632,"sku":"KWZ7N2V","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RedandGreenShatterproofOrnaments.png?v=1722012770"},{"product_id":"48-pack-silver-shatterproof","title":"Silver Shatterproof Ornaments (48 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you have kids, cats, or simply want that extra peace of mind when hanging or storing your ornament collection, you can’t go wrong with the unmatched durability of a beautiful shatterproof set. Each Silver Shatterproof Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 48 shatterproof pieces offering a refined blend of gloss and matte silvers, this lovely set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that not only demands attention but also withstands any attacks from your furry friends or little ones!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036531400,"sku":"WDE2Z3Z","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverShatterproofcopy_1.png?v=1722013751"},{"product_id":"24-pack-burgundy-essential-glass-ornament","title":"Burgundy Essential Glass Ornaments (24 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Burgundy Essential Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 24 pieces offering a beautiful blend of matte and gloss reds; this gorgeous set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e*Pairs perfectly with our Green Essential Glass Ornament Set (24 Pack).\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036695240,"sku":"ZGS7V7C","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/BurgundyEssentialOrnamentSet.png?v=1714662456"},{"product_id":"24-pack-green-essential-glass-ornament","title":"Green Essential Glass Ornaments (24 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Green Essential Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 24 pieces offering a beautiful blend of matte and gloss greens; this gorgeous set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e*Pairs perfectly with our Burgundy Essential Glass Ornament Set (24 Pack) or Red Essential Glass Ornament Set (24 Pack).\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036728008,"sku":"FQF8K5L","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P1010994copy_1.png?v=1714674759"},{"product_id":"24-pack-red-essential-glass-ornament","title":"Red Essential Glass Ornaments (24 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Red Essential Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories tha