en it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Silver Dipped Pine Cones Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the priceless memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 8 gorgeous pieces offering an elegant assortment of silver hues, this must-have set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037186760,"sku":"GAU8F2B","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverDippedPineCones1.png?v=1722013736"},{"product_id":"6-pack-silver-nutcracker","title":"Silver Nutcracker Glass Ornament Set (6 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Silver Nutcracker Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the priceless memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 6 silver pieces offering a classic vibe inside a timeless holiday staple, this must-have set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037219528,"sku":"ELZ7T7Y","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverNutcrackercopy.png?v=1722013746"},{"product_id":"6-pack-bronze-nutcracker","title":"Bronze Nutcracker Glass Ornament Set (6 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Bronze Nutcracker Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the priceless memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 6 bronze pieces offering a classic vibe inside a timeless holiday staple, this must-have set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037252296,"sku":"NSW7L9H","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingOfChristmas2025_BrookePavelPhoto005.jpg?v=1765555871"},{"product_id":"silver-ribbon","title":"Simple Silver Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eLooking for the ideal way to give your holiday\n\u003cbr\u003edecorations the traditional touch they deserve?\n\u003cbr\u003eLook no further than our Classic Silver Ribbon. With\n\u003cbr\u003estunning hue of shimmering silver, this ribbon is\n\u003cbr\u003eguaranteed to instantly elevate any holiday setting.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eClassic Silver Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037285064,"sku":"CEF6J8Q","price":39.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P1020097copy.png?v=1714674766"},{"product_id":"red-thick-ribbon","title":"Classic Red Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eCreating a memorable holiday atmosphere with\n\u003cbr\u003eyour loved ones is easy with the Classic Red\n\u003cbr\u003eRibbon. This timeless ribbon is the perfect way to\n\u003cbr\u003ecomplement your decorations for an unforgettable\n\u003cbr\u003eChristmas, season after season. Accented with\n\u003cbr\u003eexquisite gold trim to create a timeless flair, this\n\u003cbr\u003etradition-worthy ribbon will add the perfect touch\n\u003cbr\u003eof elegance to your oasis.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eClassic Red Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037317832,"sku":"JGJ2C4J","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/ClassicRedRibbon.png?v=1714662241"},{"product_id":"red-thin-ribbon","title":"Classic Thin Red Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eTalk about a timeless tradition that will never go\n\u003cbr\u003eout of style. Red ribbon has been a staple of every\n\u003cbr\u003eholiday oasis for decades. Our Classic Red Thin\n\u003cbr\u003eRibbon takes it to the next level, perfectly\n\u003cbr\u003ecomplementing your setting with a splash of red\n\u003cbr\u003ethat is accented with an elegant gold trim.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eClassic Red Thin Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037350600,"sku":"VEV5K8F","price":39.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/ClassicThinRedRibbon.png?v=1714662232"},{"product_id":"royal-green-ribbon","title":"Royal Green Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Royal Green Ribbon is a holiday must-have that\n\u003cbr\u003eadds a majestic touch to your Christmas décor. This\n\u003cbr\u003eelegant ribbon features unique gold accents that\n\u003cbr\u003ewill make your holiday oasis sparkle and shine\n\u003cbr\u003ebrighter than ever before while adding a timeless\n\u003cbr\u003etradition to your seasonal celebrations that will\n\u003cbr\u003ecreate warm memories for years to come.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eRoyal Green Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037383368,"sku":"LCV9S2E","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/1_0b9f2410-cdbe-4ce4-8695-49444202caa8.jpg?v=1718159242"},{"product_id":"gold-glitter-ribbon","title":"Gold Glitter Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the spirit of the holidays into your home with\n\u003cbr\u003eGold Glitter Ribbon from King of Christmas. Made\n\u003cbr\u003ewith sparkling glitter accents, this elegant gold\n\u003cbr\u003eribbon exudes a festive sheen and is perfect for\n\u003cbr\u003ethat traditional Christmas setting that will instill\n\u003cbr\u003ethe best memories season after season.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eGold Glitter Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037448904,"sku":"FNM3S2J","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P1020184copy.png?v=1714674770"},{"product_id":"white-glitter-ribbon","title":"White Glitter Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA perfect way to add some sparkle to your\n\u003cbr\u003echerished holiday traditions, our White Glitter\n\u003cbr\u003eRibbon was designed to make your festivities\n\u003cbr\u003emagical, merry, and memorable. Carefully crafted\n\u003cbr\u003ewith the perfect balance of glitter, this alluring\n\u003cbr\u003eribbon adds that distinct touch of holiday cheer\n\u003cbr\u003eyou’ve been looking for.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eWhite Glitter Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037481672,"sku":"KWN2M2Y","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P1010820copy.png?v=1714674753"},{"product_id":"gold-mesh-ribbon","title":"Gold Mesh Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eDetails matter when it comes to creating a\n\u003cbr\u003ememorable Christmas setting. And what better way\n\u003cbr\u003eto dress up your holiday décor than with our\n\u003cbr\u003edistinctively designed Gold Mesh Ribbon. This\n\u003cbr\u003eelegant and unique ribbon offers a mesh effect that\n\u003cbr\u003eadds an extra touch of detail to your oasis, creating\n\u003cbr\u003ea glowing ambiance that your family and guests will\n\u003cbr\u003etruly appreciate.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eGold Mesh Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037514440,"sku":"DQB3F6S","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/GoldMeshRibbon.png?v=1714671309"},{"product_id":"snowflake-ribbon","title":"Forest Snowflake Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWelcome to your holiday oasis. Our Forest\n\u003cbr\u003eSnowflake Ribbon is your perfect companion in\n\u003cbr\u003ecreating a festive scene that resembles a true\n\u003cbr\u003eholiday wonderland. With its intricately designed\n\u003cbr\u003etexture and sparkling snowflakes that hint at winter\n\u003cbr\u003emagic and festive cheer, this unique ribbon is a\n\u003cbr\u003emust-have for true Christmas enthusiasts!\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eForest Snowflake Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037547208,"sku":"XGQ7N6X","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/ForestSnowflakeRibbon_10Yards.png?v=1714671221"},{"product_id":"silver-burst-picks","title":"Silver Burst Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eSometimes you don’t know you need something\n\u003cbr\u003euntil you see it, like an elegant set of Silver Burst\n\u003cbr\u003ePicks. With a sparkling beauty that will bring joy to\n\u003cbr\u003eyou and your guests for years to come, these picks\n\u003cbr\u003eare the holiday accent that can fit in virtually\n\u003cbr\u003eanywhere. Infuse your holiday decorations with a\n\u003cbr\u003esparkling burst of silvery holiday magic.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you want to add some extra flair to your\n\u003cbr\u003ecenterpiece or inject some dimension to your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreath, garland, or tabletop display, you can’t go\n\u003cbr\u003ewrong with a stylish set of elegant holiday picks.\n\u003cbr\u003eGrab a set of 12 Silver Burst Picks for your space\n\u003cbr\u003etoday, and let your creativity run wild.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037579976,"sku":"EDS6Y5T","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverBurstPicks_12Pack.png?v=1722013727"},{"product_id":"golden-berry-picks","title":"Silver Berry Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eMake the most of your holiday setting by layering\n\u003cbr\u003ein some festive Golden Berry Picks. Perfectly sized\n\u003cbr\u003eto fit almost anywhere, these elegant picks feature\n\u003cbr\u003edetailed branches of gold-sprayed berries as a\n\u003cbr\u003esignature highlight. Add that final touch to your\n\u003cbr\u003eoasis with these cheerful decorations as you feel\n\u003cbr\u003ethe joy of the season and create memories that will\n\u003cbr\u003elast a lifetime.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you want to add some extra flair to your\n\u003cbr\u003ecenterpiece or inject some dimension to your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreath, garland, or tabletop display, you can’t go\n\u003cbr\u003ewrong with a stylish set of elegant holiday picks.\n\u003cbr\u003eGrab a set of 12 Golden Berry Picks for your space\n\u003cbr\u003etoday, and let your creativity run wild.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037612744,"sku":"VAG9S8V","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverBerryPicks_12Pack_7006c7d5-5650-4b5e-ac71-429019b0ba69.png?v=1722013720"},{"product_id":"berry-pine-picks","title":"Berry and Pine Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the beauty of the holiday season to any room\n\u003cbr\u003ewith festive Berry and Pine Picks! These elegantly\n\u003cbr\u003ecrafted accents are highlighted by festive red\n\u003cbr\u003eberries and beautiful pine branches, creating a\n\u003cbr\u003etraditional and homey holiday atmosphere that\n\u003cbr\u003eradiates unmatched feelings of comfort and joy.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you want to add some extra flair to your\n\u003cbr\u003ecenterpiece or inject some dimension to your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreath, garland, or tabletop display, you can’t go\n\u003cbr\u003ewrong with a stylish set of elegant holiday picks.\n\u003cbr\u003eGrab a set of 12 Berry and Pine Picks for your space\n\u003cbr\u003etoday, and let your creativity run wild.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946038005960,"sku":"TSX8P7B","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/BerryandPinePicks_12Pack_bdb6921a-6fa0-4e05-8782-8488df80d70b.png?v=1714662133"},{"product_id":"gold-leaf-picks","title":"Rosegold Leaf Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eCreate a beautiful, timeless holiday scene with a\n\u003cbr\u003eset of Gold Leaf Picks. These meticulously crafted\n\u003cbr\u003eholiday picks truly capture the spirit of the season\n\u003cbr\u003ewith their bold and beautiful golden leaves.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re decorating for your annual\n\u003cbr\u003eChristmas party or just adding a touch of holiday\n\u003cbr\u003echeer to your home, these elegantly detailed picks\n\u003cbr\u003ebring an inviting spirit of tradition to your holiday\n\u003cbr\u003eoasis.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you want to add some extra flair to your\n\u003cbr\u003ecenterpiece or inject some dimension to your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreath, garland, or tabletop display, you can’t go\n\u003cbr\u003ewrong with a stylish set of elegant holiday picks.\n\u003cbr\u003eGrab a set of 12 Gold Leaf Picks for your space\n\u003cbr\u003etoday, and let your creativity run wild.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946038038728,"sku":"DFJ2W4G","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingOfChristmas2025_BrookePavelPhoto012.jpg?v=1765555967"},{"product_id":"sphere-glass-ornament","title":"Sphere Glass Ornament Set (6 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eCreate the perfect holiday atmosphere this\n\u003cbr\u003eChristmas with the Sphere Glass Ornament Set!\n\u003cbr\u003eTransform your home into a winter wonderland\n\u003cbr\u003ewith these six teardrop-shaped glass ornaments\n\u003cbr\u003ethat measure 7 inches long. Each ornament is filled\n\u003cbr\u003ewith festive cheer, perfectly encapsulating the joy\n\u003cbr\u003eof the season. Hang them on your tree or around\n\u003cbr\u003ethe house to spread some holiday spirit in your\n\u003cbr\u003ehome! The whimsical design emits an aura of\n\u003cbr\u003echarm and elegance for any room. Give your living\n\u003cbr\u003espace an extra dose of seasonal magic this year\n\u003cbr\u003ewith the Sphere Glass Ornament Set!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42965630812360,"sku":"SMG9Q3V","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SphereOrnaments1.png?v=1722013853"},{"product_id":"tree-remote","title":"Tree Remote","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eMake your home glow with ease using the King of Christmas Tree Remote Control, designed to bring the beauty of your tree to life with just the touch of a button.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"535\" data-start=\"521\"\u003ePlease note:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"815\" data-start=\"536\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"625\" data-start=\"536\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"625\" data-start=\"538\"\u003eThis remote is compatible with King of Christmas tree models from 2021 and newer.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"731\" data-start=\"626\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"731\" data-start=\"628\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"660\" data-start=\"628\"\u003eFunctions vary by tree model\u003c\/strong\u003e, so be sure to check your tree’s product page for specific features.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"815\" data-start=\"732\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"815\" data-start=\"734\"\u003eNot compatible with the \u003cstrong\u003eSilverpeak Fir™\u003c\/strong\u003e or \u003cstrong data-end=\"802\" data-start=\"784\"\u003eWindsor Family\u003c\/strong\u003e collections.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"815\" data-start=\"732\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Must point the remote toward the foot pedal for it to work properly.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFINAL SALE. NO RETURNS OR EXCHANGES.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44861304537288,"sku":"TREEREMOTE","price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Screenshot2025-11-25at2.43.08PM.png?v=1764099799"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Accessories_135b3cea-8432-4bd0-b4b2-bc24d90bf4d5.jpg?v=1789054673","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/christmas-accessories.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}